@startuml kairos-member-dashboard-sequence
title Member Dashboard Load

actor Member
participant "Member App" as MemberApp
participant "Kairos API" as API
participant "DB" as DB

Member -> MemberApp: Open Dashboard
MemberApp -> API: GET /dashboard/member
API -> DB: SELECT attendance summary,\ngiving summary, upcoming events,\njoined departments
DB --> API: Member dashboard data
API --> MemberApp: 200 OK {attendance, giving, events, departments}

MemberApp --> Member: Render cards & sections

@enduml
